          "name": "No Replace Identical",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        },
        {
          "name": "Prompt",
          "type": "Bool",
          "default": "false"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Int",
      "docs": "Export this object to a file.  Child classes do not override this, but they do provide an Export() function\nto do the resource-specific export work.\n@param\tObject\t\t\t\tthe object to export\n@param\tInExporter\t\t\texporter to use for exporting this object.  If NULL, attempts to create a valid exporter.\n@param\tFilename\t\t\tthe name of the file to export this object to\n@param\tInSelectedOnly\t\t@todo\n@param\tNoReplaceIdentical\tfalse if we always want to overwrite any existing files, even if they're identical\n@param\tPrompt\t\t\t\ttrue if the user should be prompted to checkout/overwrite the output file if it already exists and is read-only\n@return\t1 if the the object was successfully exported, 0 if a fatal error was encountered during export"
    },
